    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_51dc512c6f29ce9",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID7",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Practice 2 feedback",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"max-width:680px;font-size:16px;color:#1f2933;\"><p style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2f5d8a;margin:0 0 4px;\">Practice 2 of 2</p><p style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;\">Answer</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;border-left:3px solid #bcc6cf;padding-left:12px;color:#5f6b7a;margin:0 0 12px;\">Question 7 was really confusing, I wasn't sure if it meant my current job or my last one. Also a bit long.</p><div style=\"border-left:4px solid #2f7a4a;background:#eef7f0;border-radius:6px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>WORDING.</b> The comment mentions two things and is mainly about the confusing question, so that is the category. The remark about length is not recorded.</div><div style=\"border-left:4px solid #c98a12;background:#fff8e8;border-radius:6px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>Batch 1 starts on the next page.</b> Your labels there count.</div></div>",
        "QuestionType": "DB",
