        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"max-width:680px;font-size:16px;color:#1f2933;\"><p style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2f5d8a;margin:0 0 4px;\">Batch 2</p><p style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.35;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 12px;\">Batch 2: eight new comments</p><div style=\"border-left:4px solid #2f5d8a;background:#f3f6fa;border-radius:6px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.6;\">While the coding supervisor reviews batch 1 and anything you sent with it, here is batch 2: eight comments from a different study. <b>The coding rules are the same as for batch 1.</b></div></div>",
